KUKA LBR iisy 8 R930, arm-only MuJoCo model.

Source
  KUKA's official ROS 2 robot descriptions: https://github.com/kroshu/kuka_robot_descriptions
  Package kuka_lbr_iisy_support, robot lbr_iisy8_r930, commit d2fa4377 (6 Oct 2026).
